+//*************************************************************************
+//
+// V3EmitDesignDb emits a C++ source file containing static data tables
+// that describe the elaborated design: signals, driver/load relationships,
+// and source locations.  The generated file is compiled into a shared
+// library (lib<top>__DesignDb.so) that xdebug can load at runtime via
+// dlopen() to perform trace.driver / trace.load queries without NPI.
+//
