@@ -0,0 +1,88 @@
+//----------------------------------------------------------------------
+// SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2011 Mentor Graphics Corporation
+// SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
+//   Copyright 2011 Mentor Graphics Corporation
+//   All Rights Reserved Worldwide
